// ghost/fax/cap have dedicated opcodes and never reach the constant pool.
// The pool dedupes a repeated string. Literal arithmetic is folded at
// compile time -- `2 + 3 * 4` becomes the single constant 14 -- but folding
// stops at a division by zero, which is a *runtime* error and has to stay
// one, so `1 / 0` still emits DIV.
yap ghost
yap fax
yap cap
yap "hi"
yap "hi"
yap 2 + 3 * 4
yap 1 / 0
